<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx6.SSx4" title="In Discussion ‣ PILOT: Steering Synthetic Data Generation withPsychological &amp; Linguistic Output Targeting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In PILOT: Steering Synthetic Data Generation withPsychological &amp; Linguistic Output Targeting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
